#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:1
msgid "llvm-locstats - calculate statistics on DWARF debug location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:8
msgid "{program}`llvm-locstats` \\[*options*\\] \\[*filename*\\]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:10
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:12
msgid ""
"{program}`llvm-locstats` works like a wrapper around {program}`llvm-"
"dwarfdump`. It parses {program}`llvm-dwarfdump` statistics regarding debug "
"location by pretty printing it in a more human-readable way."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:16
msgid ""
"The line 0% shows the number and the percentage of DIEs with no location "
"information, but the line 100% shows the information for DIEs where there is "
"location information in all code section bytes (where the variable or "
"parameter is in the scope). The line \\[50%,60%) shows the number and the "
"percentage of DIEs where the location information is between 50 and 60 "
"percentage of its scope covered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:23
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:26
msgid "calculate the location statistics only for local variables"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:30
msgid "calculate the location statistics only for formal parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:34
msgid ""
"ignore the location statistics on locations containing the debug entry "
"values DWARF operation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:39
msgid "make histogram of location buckets generated (requires matplotlib)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:44
msgid ""
"compare the debug location coverage on two files provided, and draw a plot "
"showing the difference (requires matplotlib)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:48
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-locstats.md:50
msgid ""
"{program}`llvm-locstats` returns 0 if the input file were parsed "
"successfully. Otherwise, it returns 1."
msgstr ""

